### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

June 8, 2021
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-33-21 for furnishing One (1) New 2021-2022 Portable
Trommel Compost, Topsoil Screen Plant, for the City of Cheyenne,
Sanitation/Compost Division
______________________________________________
One (1) bidder responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The One (1) Bid was received from:
1. Argus Industrial Co. Pontiac, Michigan.
a. (Bid In Compliance, Bid Exceptions Present).

The bid was reviewed by Vicki Nemecek (Public Works), Craig LaVoy (Public Works), Matt
Theriault (Landfill and Compost Manager), and Bryan Bell (Fleet Maintenance).  Their
recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Argus Industrial Co., for One (1) New
2021-2022 Portable Trommel Compost, Topsoil Screen Plant, Less Trade In, for a bid award
amount of $131,971.67.

Funding:
023-14-1423-43-43102 (Solid Waste Fund / Equipment)

Total $131,971.67
```

